BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (Brinewright) Tj T* () Tj T* (Executive Summary: Brinewright) Tj T* () Tj T* (Problem) Tj T* () Tj T* (Fermented vegetables such as sauerkraut, kimchi and pickled carrots are popular, and many) Tj T* (people say they want to make them at home. Yet a large share of those people never start. In) Tj T* (informal conversations with about forty classmates, neighbors and relatives, the most common) Tj T* (reason was fear: fear of using the wrong amount of salt, fear of mold, and fear of not being) Tj T* (able to tell whether a batch is safe to eat. Existing recipes online give conflicting advice,) Tj T* (and most assume the reader already knows what a healthy ferment looks like. Teachers face a) Tj T* (similar barrier. Fermentation is a natural way to teach microbiology and chemistry, but few) Tj T* (teachers have the time to source materials, test recipes and write safety instructions on their) Tj T* (own.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Solution) Tj T* () Tj T* (Brinewright sells small-batch fermentation kits designed to take the intimidation out of the) Tj T* (process. Every kit includes a glass jar with an airlock lid, salt pre-measured for the specific) Tj T* (vegetable and quantity, pH test strips so users can confirm that their ferment has reached a) Tj T* (safe acidity, and a day-by-day printed guide with photographs showing what normal and abnormal) Tj T* (batches look like. The guide ends with a clear rule for when to eat and when to discard.) Tj T* () Tj T* (We offer two versions. The Home Kit is delivered monthly or bought one at a time, with a) Tj T* (rotating seasonal vegetable and flavor theme. The Classroom Kit contains materials for a group) Tj T* (of up to thirty students, along with lesson plans for middle and high school science units,) Tj T* (observation worksheets, and a teacher safety checklist. Both versions include access to an) Tj T* (online guide where users can compare photographs of their batches against reference images.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Market) Tj T* () Tj T* (We believe the market includes two groups. The first is home cooks interested in gut health,) Tj T* (flavor and food projects, a group that has grown alongside interest in sourdough baking and) Tj T* (home pickling. The second is the school science market, where teachers are looking for hands-on) Tj T* (activities that connect to curriculum standards. We have not yet completed a formal market) Tj T* (study. As a rough estimate, if a small fraction of adults who say they are interested in) Tj T* (fermenting actually bought a kit each year, the Home Kit market would be in the tens of) Tj T* (millions of dollars nationally. For schools, there are tens of thousands of middle and high) Tj T* (schools in the country, and we assume a small share might spend a modest classroom supply) Tj T* (budget on a product like ours. We plan to start in our own region, where we can deliver quickly) Tj T* (and meet customers in person, before shipping nationally.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Business Model) Tj T* () Tj T* (We plan to earn revenue from three sources. The Home Kit would sell for about twenty-eight) Tj T* (dollars as a single purchase or twenty-four dollars per month as a subscription. The Classroom) Tj T* (Kit would sell for about ninety dollars per class set. We also hope to sell refill packs of) Tj T* (salt and test strips to returning customers. Based on our prototype costs, we estimate that) Tj T* (materials and packaging for a Home Kit come to roughly eleven dollars, with shipping adding) Tj T* (another six to eight dollars, which leaves a modest margin. We expect costs to fall with larger) Tj T* (orders from suppliers, although we have not yet received firm quotes at volume. We plan to) Tj T* (reach customers mainly through social media, cooking communities, and direct outreach to) Tj T* (teachers, and we have not yet worked out what it will cost us to acquire a customer.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Competition) Tj T* () Tj T* (The space is crowded. Several companies sell fermentation crocks, airlock lids and starter) Tj T* (cultures, and a number of meal kit and pantry subscription services have offered pickling or) Tj T* (fermenting boxes as limited editions. Cookbooks, video channels and online forums offer free) Tj ET
endstream
