BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (instruction. Science supply companies already sell general classroom kits. We think Brinewright) Tj T* (differs in focusing on safety and confidence rather than on equipment or recipes alone, and in) Tj T* (serving both home and classroom users with the same core product. We recognize that a larger) Tj T* (competitor could copy our approach, and that our main advantage today is our focus and our) Tj T* (willingness to test closely with beginners.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Maya Okonkwo-Reyes is a senior studying food science and leads product development and safety) Tj T* (testing. She has two years of experience working in a campus food lab and designed the salt) Tj T* (ratios and pH checkpoints used in our prototype. Daniel Ferreira Lindqvist is a junior in) Tj T* (business administration and leads operations, supplier contacts and pricing. He previously ran) Tj T* (a small online resale shop and handled its shipping. Priya Venkataraghavan is a senior in) Tj T* (science education and leads the classroom materials, drawing on student teaching placements in) Tj T* (two middle schools. We have not yet recruited an advisor with experience in food regulation or) Tj T* (consumer packaged goods, and we know this is a gap.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (To date we have defined the core concept, built a working prototype kit, and made our first) Tj T* (batches in our own kitchens and a campus lab. We registered the venture name with our) Tj T* (university's entrepreneurship program, though we have not yet formed a legal entity. Twelve) Tj T* (home cooks and one middle school science class have used early versions of the kit, and we) Tj T* (collected written feedback from most of them. Participants generally said that the pH strips) Tj T* (and photo guide made them feel more confident, and several asked for more flavor options. We) Tj T* (have not yet charged for any kit, so we have no revenue. Our spending so far, about nine) Tj T* (hundred dollars, came from the founders' personal savings and covered jars, salt, strips and) Tj T* (printing. We do not yet have a website.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are applying for competition funding of up to ten thousand dollars. We would use roughly) Tj T* (four thousand dollars for a first production run of one hundred Home Kits and twenty Classroom) Tj T* (Kits, three thousand dollars for legal formation, basic liability insurance and food safety) Tj T* (review, two thousand dollars for a simple website and ordering system, and the remainder for) Tj T* (testing and shipping. Beyond funding, we are seeking mentorship from judges or alumni with) Tj T* (experience in food products, regulatory compliance and direct-to-consumer sales, as well as) Tj T* (introductions to teachers and school purchasing contacts. Our goal over the next six months is) Tj T* (to sell out the first run, learn what customers will actually pay, and decide whether the home) Tj T* (or the classroom market should be our main focus.) Tj ET
